#: accounts.cpp:45
msgid "Account Setup"
msgstr "Apontiaedje do conte"

#: accounts.cpp:66
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "Candjî..."

#: accounts.cpp:68
msgid "Allows you to modify the selected account"
msgstr "Po candjî li conte tchwezi"

#: accounts.cpp:77
msgid "New..."
msgstr "Novea..."

#: accounts.cpp:81
msgid ""
"Create a new dialup connection\n"
"to the internet"
msgstr ""
"Fé on novea loyén a l' Eternet\n"
"på telefone"

#: accounts.cpp:89
msgid ""
"Makes a copy of the selected account. All\n"
"settings of the selected account are copied\n"
"to a new account, that you can modify to fit your\n"
"needs"
msgstr ""
"Po copyî li conte tchwezi. Tos les\n"
"apontiaedjes do conte tchwezi sont copyîs\n"
"dins li novea conte. Après, vos l' poloz candjîs\n"
"a vosse môde."

#: accounts.cpp:99
msgid ""
"Deletes the selected account\n"
"\n"
"<red><b>Use with care!"
msgstr ""
"Po disfacer li conte tchwezi\n"
"\n"
"<red><b>Loukîz a vosse sogne!"

#: accounts.cpp:108
msgid "Phone Costs:"
msgstr "Costindjes di telefone:"

#: accounts.cpp:121
msgid ""
"This shows the accumulated phone costs\n"
"for the selected account.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: If you have more than one \n"
"account - beware, this is <b>NOT</b> the sum \n"
"of the phone costs of all your accounts!"
msgstr ""
"Po mostrer li totå des costindjes di telefone\n"
"po onk di vos contes.\n"
"<b>Atincion</b>: si vos avoz di pus d' on\n"
"conte, çouci n' est <b>NÉN</b> li some\n"
"des costindjes di tos vos contes!"

#: accounts.cpp:128 conwindow.cpp:54
msgid "Volume:"
msgstr "Volume:"

#: accounts.cpp:140
msgid ""
"This shows the number of bytes transferred\n"
"for the selected account (not for all of your\n"
"accounts. You can select what to display in\n"
"the accounting dialog.\n"
"\n"
"<link #volaccounting>More on volume accounting</link>"
msgstr ""
"Vochal li nombe di bytes k' ont voyaedjî\n"
"pol conte tchwezi (et nén po tos les\n"
"contes. Vos poloz tchwezi çu k' i fåt mostrer\n"
"el divize des contes.\n"
"\n"
"<link #volaccounting>Savu did pus so li volume</link>"

#: accounts.cpp:152
msgid "Reset Costs"
msgstr "Rimete les Costindjes a Zerô"

#: accounts.cpp:158
msgid "View Logs"
msgstr "Mostrer l' istwere"

#: accounts.cpp:224
msgid "Reset Total"
msgstr "Rimete li Totå a Zerô"

#: accounts.cpp:225
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset the accumulated\n"
"telephone costs for the selected account to zero?"
msgstr ""
"Estoz-ve sheur(e) ki vos voloz rmete a zerô\n"
"les costindjes di telefone po ci conte la?"


