#: edit.cpp:43
msgid "Dial Setup"
msgstr "Apontiaedje do raloyaedje"

#: edit.cpp:46
msgid "Connection Name:"
msgstr "No do raloyaedje:"

#: edit.cpp:56
msgid "Type in a unique name for this connection"
msgstr "Tapez on no po ci raloyaedje ci"

#: edit.cpp:59
msgid "Phone Number:"
msgstr "Limerô di telefone"

#: edit.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Specifies the phone number to dial. You\n"
"can supply multiple numbers separated by\n"
"a colon. When a number is busy or fails,\n"
"<i>kppp</i>will try the next number and so on"
msgstr ""
"Limerô di telefone a fé. Vos\n"
"poloz bén dner sacwants limerôs avou deus pont\n"
"inte tchaeke limerô. Cwand on limerô e-st ocupé on fwait,\n"
"berwete, <i>kppp</i>saye li shûvant."

#: edit.cpp:75
msgid "Authentication:"
msgstr "Ricnoxhance:"

#: edit.cpp:79
msgid "Script-based"
msgstr "Avou on scrip"

#: edit.cpp:80
msgid "PAP"
msgstr "PAP"

#: edit.cpp:81
msgid "Terminal-based"
msgstr "So terminå"

#: edit.cpp:82
msgid "CHAP"
msgstr "CHAP"

#: edit.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Specifies the method used to identify yourself to\n"
"the PPP server. Most universities still use\n"
"<b>Terminal</b>- or <b>Script</b>-based authtentication,\n"
"while most ISP use <b>PAP</b> and/or <b>CHAP</b>. If\n"
"unsure, contact your ISP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can choose between PAP and CHAP,\n"
"choose CHAP, because it's much safer."
msgstr ""
"Manîre di vos fé ricnoxhe pol sierveu\n"
"PPP. D' abôrd totes les univiersité eployèt co\n"
"li ricnoxhance so <b>terminå</b> ou pa <b>scrip</b>.\n"
"Mins les ahesseu Eternet eployèt <b>PAP</b> eyet/ou <b>CHAP</b>. Si\n"
"vos n' savoz nén, dimandez a voste ahesseu Eternet.\n"
"\n"
"Si vos poloz bén tchwezi inte PAP eyet CHAP,\n"
"purdoz CHAP, k' est bråmint pus sheur."

#: edit.cpp:97
msgid "Store password"
msgstr "Ritni li mot di passe"

#: edit.cpp:101
msgid ""
"When this is turned on, your ISP password\n"
"will be saved in <i>kppp</i>'s config file, so\n"
"you do not need to type it in everytime.\n"
"\n"
"<b><red>Warning:<black> your password will be stored as\n"
"plain text in the config file, which is\n"
"readable only to you. Make sure nobody\n"
"gains access to this file!"
msgstr ""
"Si vos tchwezixhoz çouchal, vosse mot di passe\n"
"serè schapé dins lio fitchî d' apontiaedje di <i>kppp</i>,\n"
"do côp, vos nel duvroz nén taper a tot côp bon.\n"
"\n"
"<b><red>Loukîz a vosse sogne:<black> vosse mot di passe est\n"
"schapé come do texe è fitchî d' apontiaedje, ki vos estoz\n"
"tot seu a savu lere. Tirez vosse plan po ki nolu d' ôte\n"
"ni våye herer si narene è ci fitchî la!"

#: edit.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Execute program\n"
"upon connect:"
msgstr ""
"Programe a-z enonder\n"
"å moumint ki dji so raloyî:"

#: edit.cpp:121
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>after</b> a connection\n"
"is established. When your program is called, all\n"
"all preparations for an internet connection are\n"
"finished.\n"
"\n"
"Very usefull for fetching mail and news"
msgstr ""
"Po-z enonder on programe <b>après</b> ki vos estoz\n"
"raloyî. Cwand vosse programe s' enonde, c' est ki totes\n"
"les apresses po on raloyaedje a l' Eternet sont\n"
"fwaites.\n"
"\n"
"Foirt ahessåve po-z aler cweri ses emiles ou les noveles."

#: edit.cpp:129
msgid ""
"Execute program\n"
"before disconnect:"
msgstr ""
"Programe a-z enonder divant\n"
"di m' disraloyî:"

#: edit.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>before</b> a connection\n"
"is closed. The connection will stay open until\n"
"the program exits."
msgstr ""
"Po-z enonder on programe <b>divant</b> di vos\n"
"disraloyî. Vos seroz raloyî ossi lontins ki\n"
"li programe toûne."

#: edit.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Execute program\n"
"upon disconnect:"
msgstr ""
"Programe a-z enonder å moumint\n"
"di m' disraloyî:"

#: edit.cpp:157
msgid ""
"Allows you to run a program <b>after</b> a connection\n"
"has been closed."
msgstr ""
"Po-z enonder on programe <b>après</b> ki vos\n"
"estoz disraloyî."

#: edit.cpp:161
msgid "Edit pppd arguments:"
msgstr "Candjî les årgumints di pppd:"

#: edit.cpp:166
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "Årgumints"

#: edit.cpp:223
msgid "IP Setup"
msgstr "Apontiedje di l' ahesseu Eternet"

#: edit.cpp:229
msgid "IP Address:"
msgstr "Adresse di l' ahesseu"

#: edit.cpp:232
msgid ""
"If your computer has a permanent internet\n"
"address, you must supply your IP address here"
msgstr ""
"Si voste éndjole a ene adresse Eternet da lu,\n"
"vos l' divoz taper chal"

# xxx What's this?
#: edit.cpp:237
msgid "Subnet Mask:"
msgstr "xxx Subnet Mask:"

#: edit.cpp:240
msgid ""
"If your computer has a static Internet address,\n"
"you must supply a network mask here. In almost\n"
"all cases this netmask will be <b>255.255.255.0</b>,\n"
"but your mileage may vary.\n"
"\n"
"If unsure, contact your Internet Service Provider"
msgstr ""
"Si vosse copiutrece a ene adresse Eternet ki n' candje måy,\n" 
"vos dvoz dner on masse di rantoele droci. Cåzu a tot côp bon,\n" 
"li masse serè <b>255.255.255.0</b>,\n" 
"mins ça pôreut esse ôtrumint por vos.\n" 
"\n" 
"Si vos n' savoz nén, atauchîz voste ahesseu Eternet." 

#: edit.cpp:254
msgid "Dynamic IP Address"
msgstr "Adresse Eternet dinamike"

#: edit.cpp:256
msgid ""
"Select this option when your computer gets an\n"
"internet address (IP) everytime a\n"
"connection is made.\n"
"\n"
"Almost every Internet Service Provider uses\n"
"this method, so this should be turned on."
msgstr ""
"Tchewzixhoz çouci si vosse copiutrece rishût\n" 
"ene adresse Eternet a tchaeke feye ki vos\n" 
"vos raloyîz.\n" 
"\n" 
"D' abôrd tos les ahesseus Eternet fijhèt insi,\n" 
"do côp vos duvrîz dandjureu tchwezi çouci." 


#: edit.cpp:264
msgid "Static IP Address"
msgstr "Adress Eternet estatike"

#: edit.cpp:268
msgid ""
"Select this option when your computer has a\n"
"fixed internet address (IP). Most computers\n"
"don't have this, so you should probably select\n"
"dynamic IP addressing unless you know what you\n"
"are doing"
msgstr ""
"Tchwezixhoz çouci si voste éndjole a\n" 
"ene adresse Eternet metuwe on côp po totes. Gn a waire di copiutreces\n" 
"k' ont ene adresse insi, do côp vos duvrîz dandjureu tchwezi\n" 
"l' adresse dinamike, a pus ki vos savoz\n" 
"çu ki vos fjhoz." 



#: edit.cpp:274
msgid "Auto-configure hostname from this IP"
msgstr "Apontyî tot seu li no do lodjeu a pårti di ciste adresse"

#: edit.cpp:279
msgid ""
"Whenever you connect, this reconfigures\n"
"your hostname to match the IP address you\n"
"got from the PPP server. This may be useful\n"
"if you need to use a protocol which depends\n"
"on this information, but it can also cause several\n"
"<link kppp-7.html#autohostname>problems</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Don't enable this unless you really need it"
msgstr ""
"A tchaeke côp ki vos vos raloyîz, cisse tchûze chal rapontieye\n" 
"vosse no di lodjeu po-z aler avou l' adresse Eternet ki vos rçuvoz\n" 
"do sierveu PPP. Ça pôreut esse ahessåve si\n" 
"vos vos dvoz siervi d' on protocole ki tént a\n" 
"ciste informåcion. Mins ça pôreut ossi dner sacwantès\n" 
"<link kppp-7.html#autohostname>rûjhes</link>.\n" 
"\n" 
"Do côp, ni tchwezixhoz nén çouci, a pus ki vos nd årîz dandjî po do bon." 

#: edit.cpp:396
msgid "DNS Servers"
msgstr "Sierveus DNS"

#: edit.cpp:411
msgid "Domain Name:"
msgstr "No di dominne:"

#: edit.cpp:422
msgid ""
"If you enter a domain name here, this domain\n"
"name is used for your computer while you are\n"
"connected. When the connection is closed, the\n"
"original domain name of your computer is\n"
"restored.\n"
"\n"
"If you leave this field blank, no changes are\n"
"made to the domain name."
msgstr ""
"Si vos metoz on no di dominne droci, c' est ci no la\n" 
"ki vårè po vosse copiutrece tot li tins ki vos seroz\n" 
"raloyî. Å momint ki vos vos disraloyroz, li no di dominne\n" 
"ki vos avîz divant po voste éndjole serè\n" 
"rmetu.\n" 
"\n" 
"Si vos n' metoz rén vaici, vosse no di dominne\n" 
"ni serè nén candjî."


#: edit.cpp:431
msgid "DNS IP Address:"
msgstr "Adresse Eternet DNS"

#: edit.cpp:446
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify a new DNS server to be\n"
"used while you are connected. When the\n"
"connection is closed, this DNS entry will be\n"
"removed again.\n"
"\n"
"To add a DNS server, type in the IP address of\n"
"of the DNS server here and click on <b>Add</b>"
msgstr ""
"Chal, vos poloz mete on novea sierveu DNS po cwand\n" 
"vos seroz raloyî. Å moumint ki vos vos\n" 
"disraloyoz, li no di DNS est\n" 
"waesté.\n" 
"\n" 
"Po radjouter on sierveu DNS, tapez l' adresse Eternet\n" 
"do sierveu DNS chal, et adon clitchîz so <b>Radjouter</b>" 


#: edit.cpp:465
msgid ""
"Click this button to add the DNS server\n"
"specified in the field above. The entry\n"
"will then be added to the list below"
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz so ci boton po radjouter li sierveu DNS\n" 
"vaici pa dzeu. Ciste intreye la\n" 
"serè radjouteye al djîveye pa dzo."

#: edit.cpp:477
msgid ""
"Click this button to remove the selected DNS\n"
"server entry from the list below"
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz chal po bodjî li DNS tchwezi foû\n"
"del djîveye pa dzo."


#: edit.cpp:480
msgid "DNS Address List:"
msgstr "Djîveye des adresses DNS:"

#: edit.cpp:491
msgid ""
"This shows all defined DNS servers to use\n"
"while you are connected. Use the <b>Add</b> and\n"
"<b>Remove</b> buttons to modify the list"
msgstr ""
"Chal, vos veyoz tos les sierveus DNS a eployî\n"
"tins ki vos estoz raloyî. Eployîz les botons <b>Radjouter</b>\n"
"eyet <b>Rssaetchî</b> po candjî li djîveye."

# xxx disable, enable. Hmmm... 
#: edit.cpp:496
msgid "Disable existing DNS Servers during Connection"
msgstr ""
"Disclitchîz les sierveu DNS ki vos avoz\n"
"tins ki vos estoz raloyî."
#: edit.cpp:503
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, all DNS\n"
"servers specified in <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i> are\n"
"temporary disabled while the dialup connection\n"
"is established. After the connection is\n"
"closed, the servers will be re-enabled\n"
"\n"
"Typically, there is no reason to use this\n"
"option, but it may become useful under \n"
"some circumstances"
msgstr ""
"Avou cisse tchûze lan tos les sierveus DNS\n"
"dins <i>/etc/resolv.conf</i> seront\n"
"disclitchî ossi lontins ki vos seroz raloyî a voste\n"
"ahesseu. Ene feye ki vos vos disraloyîz,\n"
"les sierveus sont raclitchîs.\n"
"\n"
"Normålmint, gn a pont d' avance do candjî cisse\n"
"tchûze, mins ça pout todi siervi\n"
"des côps k' i gn a."

# C' est cwè å djusse on gateway - splitchî a ref001
#: edit.cpp:572
msgid "Gateway Setup"
msgstr "Apontiaedje do pontea"

# C' est cwè å djusse on gateway - splitchî a ref001
#: edit.cpp:581
msgid "Default Gateway"
msgstr "Pontea tchwezi por vos"

# ref001
#: edit.cpp:584
msgid ""
"This makes the PPP peer computer (the computer\n"
"you are connected to with your modem) to act as\n"
"a gateway. Your computer will send all packets not\n"
"going to a computer inside your local net to this\n"
"computer, which will route this packets.\n"
"\n"
"This is the default for most ISPs, so you should\n"
"probably leave this option on"
msgstr ""
"C' est ci 'pontea' la ki permet al copiutrece PPP (li cine\n"
"ki vos estoz raloyî avou vosse modem) di fé do\n"
"'pontea'. Voste éndjole evoye tot çu ki n' est nén pol\n"
"rantoele so plaece a cisse copiutrece 'pontea' et\n"
"c' est leye, k' evoye les pakets di doneyes pus lon.\n"
"\n"
"C' e-st insi ki cåzu tos les ahesseus Eternet ovrèt; do côp,\n"
"normålmint, vos n' avoz nén a candjî çoula."

#: edit.cpp:595
msgid "Static Gateway"
msgstr "Staté Pontea"

#: edit.cpp:598
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify which computer you want\n"
"to use as gateway (see <i>Default Gateway</i> above"
msgstr ""
"Çouchal, c' est por vos savu dîre kéne éndjole ki vos v' voloz\n"
"siervi come pontea (waitîz <i>Pontea tchwezi por vos</i>"

#: edit.cpp:603
msgid ""
"Gateway\n"
"IP Address:"
msgstr ""
"Pontea\n"
"Adresse Eternet (IP):"

#: edit.cpp:605
msgid "Assign the Default Route to this Gateway"
msgstr "Li voye tchwezeye på pontea"

#: edit.cpp:608
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, all packets not\n"
"going to the local net are routed through\n"
"the PPP connection.\n"
"\n"
"Normally, you should turn this on"
msgstr ""
"Si vos purdoz cisse tchûze la, tos les pakets (såf les cis\n"
"pol rantoele locåle) end îront pal raloyaedje\n"
"PPP.\n"
"\n"
"Normålmint, cisse tchûze la doet esse metuwe."

#: edit.cpp:703
msgid "Edit Script"
msgstr "Candjî li Scrip"

#: general.cpp:50
msgid "kppp Setup"
msgstr "Apontyî kppp"

#: general.cpp:56
msgid "pppd Timeout:"
msgstr "Ratinde pppd:"

#: general.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<i>kppp</i> will wait this number of seconds\n"
"to see if a PPP connection is established.\n"
"If no connection is made in this time frame,\n"
"<i>kppp</i> will give up and kill pppd."
msgstr ""
"<i>kppp</i> rawådrè ça lotins (è segondes)\n"
"po vey si on raloyaedje PPP si fwait comufåt.\n"
"Si vos n' estoz nén raloyî passé ci tins la,\n"
"<i>kppp</i> si djocrè et tuwer pppd."

#: general.cpp:74 general.cpp:401 general.cpp:490
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Segondes"

#: general.cpp:87
msgid "Dock into Panel on Connect"
msgstr "Herer è scriftôr on côp raloyî"

#: general.cpp:89
msgid ""
"After a connection is established, the\n"
"window is minimized and a small icon\n"
"in the <i>kpanel</i> represents this window.\n"
"\n"
"Clicking on this icon will restore the\n"
"window to it's original location and\n"
"size."
msgstr ""
"On côp ki vos estoz raloyî, li\n"
"purnea est raptiti et ene pitite imådjete\n"
"divins <i>kpanel</i> reprezinte li purnea.\n"
"\n"
"Si vos clitchîz so l' imådjete, li purnea\n"
"si rmetrè al plaece et al grandeu k' elle\n"
"esteut dvant."

#: general.cpp:102
msgid "Automatic Redial on Disconnect"
msgstr "Rifé li limerô si nos estans disraloyîs"

#: general.cpp:108
msgid ""
"When a connection is established and\n"
"it somehow gets disconnected, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"will try to reconnect to the same account.\n"
"\n"
"See <link #redial>here</link> for more on this topic."
msgstr ""
"Ene feye ki vos estoz raloyî(eye) et ki, po ene råjhon\n"
"ou l' ôte, vos estoz côpé ou disraloyî, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"sayrè di v' raloyî eco on côp å minme conte.\n"
"\n"
"Waitîz <link #redial>vêci</link> po-z è savu d' pus."

# xxx caption
#: general.cpp:114
msgid "Show Clock on Caption"
msgstr "Mostrer l' ôrlodje el ledjinde"

#: general.cpp:120
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the window\n"
"title shows the time since a connection\n"
"was established. Very useful, so you \n"
"should turn this on"
msgstr ""
"Si vos tchwezixhoz çouci, li tite do\n"
"purnea vos mosterrè li tins passé dispû\n"
"ki vos estoz raloyî. Ahessåve, edon?\n"
"Vos duvrîz mete ciste usteye èn alaedje!"

#: general.cpp:125
msgid "Disconnect on X-server shutdown"
msgstr "Disraloyî cwand li sierveu X est cloyu"

#: general.cpp:131
msgid ""
"Checking this option will close any\n"
"open connection when the X-server is\n"
"shut down. You should enable this option\n"
"unless you know what you are doing.\n"
"\n"
"See <link #disxserver>here</link> for more on this."
msgstr ""
"SI vos tchwezixhoz çouci, vos seroz tafetmint\n"
"disraloyî å moumint ki li sierveu X\n"
"serè cloyu. Eclitchîz cisse tchûze, a pus\n"
"ki vos sepoz bén çu ki vos fjhoz.\n"
"\n"
"Waitîz <link #disxserver>chal</link> po-z è savu did pus."

#: general.cpp:138
msgid "Quit on Disconnect"
msgstr "Cwiter å moumint di s' disraloyî"

#: general.cpp:144
msgid ""
"When this option is turned on, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"will be closed when you disconnect"
msgstr ""
"Cwand çouci est tchwezi, <i>kppp</i>\n"
"serè cloyu cwand vos vos disraloyîz."

#: general.cpp:147
msgid "Minimize Window on Connect"
msgstr "Raptiti li purnea do côp ki vos estoz raloyî"

#: general.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Iconifies <i>kppp</i>'s window when a\n"
"connection is established"
msgstr ""
"Po mete li purnea di <i>kppp</i> a imådjete\n"
"do côp ki vos estoz raloyî."

#: general.cpp:202
msgid "About kppp"
msgstr "Å dfait di kppp"

#: general.cpp:210
msgid ""
"\n"
"A dialer and front-end to pppd\n"
"\n"
"(c) 1997, 1998\n"
"    Bernd Johannes Wuebben <wuebben@kde.org>\n"
"    Harri Porten <porten@kde.org>\n"
"    Mario Weilguni <mweilguni@kde.org>\n"
"\n"
"Original author: Bernd Johannes Wuebben\n"
"Currently maintained by Harri Porten and Mario\n"
"Weilguni. Please send all bug reports to the\n"
"current maintainer.\n"
"\n"
"This program is distributed under the GNU GPL\n"
"(GNU General Public License)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ene usteye po fé des limerôs et on bea viazedje so pppd\n"
"\n"
"(c) 1997, 1998\n"
"    Bernd Johannes Wuebben <wuebben@kde.org>\n"
"    Harri Porten <porten@kde.org>\n"
"    Mario Weilguni <mweilguni@kde.org>\n"
"\n"
"Prumî auteur: Bernd Johannes Wuebben\n"
"Manaedjî enut på Harri Porten et på Mario\n"
"Weilguni. Gråce d' evoyî les anonces di bug\n"
"å manaedjeu d' enut.\n"
"\n"
"Ci programe est spårdu dzo li GNU GPL\n"
"(GNU General Public License)."

#: general.cpp:238
msgid "Serial device"
msgstr "Indjin di sereye"

#: general.cpp:241
msgid "Modem Device:"
msgstr "Indjin do modem:"

#: general.cpp:255
msgid ""
"This specifies the serial port your modem is attached \n"
"to. On Linux/x86, typically this is either /dev/ttyS0 \n"
"(COM1 under DOS) or /dev/ttyS1 (COM2 under DOS).\n"
"\n"
"If you have an internal ISDN card with AT command\n"
"emulation (most cards under Linux support this), you\n"
"should select one of the /dev/ttyIx devices."
msgstr ""
"Vêci, vos djhoz a ké pôrt sereye ki vosse modem est\n"
"raloyî. Dizo Linux/x86, c' est tipicmint a /dev/ttyS0 \n"
"(COM1 dzo DOS) ou /dev/ttyS1 (COM2 dzo DOS).\n"
"\n"
"Si vos avoz ene divintrinne cåte ISDN ki chine les cmandes\n"
"AT (et d' abôrd tote les cåtes dizo Linux el fijhèt), vos duvrîz\n"
"tchûzi èn indjin del sereye /dev/ttyIx."

# xxx flow of what?
#: general.cpp:264
msgid "Flow Control:"
msgstr "Maistriaedje do corant:"

#: general.cpp:270
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nouk"

#: general.cpp:279
msgid ""
"Specifies how the serial port and modem\n"
"communicate. You should not change this unless\n"
"you know what you are doing.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: CRTSCTS"
msgstr ""
"Po dîre comint-ce ki li pôrt sereye eyet li modem\n"
"s' atauchèt. Ni candjîz rén chal, a pus ki vos savoz\n"
"bén çu ki vos fjhoz.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tchwezi por vos</b>: CRTSCTS"

#: general.cpp:285
msgid "Line Termination:"
msgstr "Côper li lene"

#: general.cpp:298
msgid ""
"Specifies how AT commands are send to your\n"
"modem. Most modems will work fine with the\n"
"default <i>CR/LF</i>. If your modem does not react\n"
"to the init string, you should try different\n"
"settings here\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: CR/LF"
msgstr ""
"Po dîre comint-ce ki les cmandes AT sont-st\n"
"evoyeyes a vosse modem. D' abôrd tos les modems rotront\n"
"comufåt avou çu k' est tchwezi por vos :<i>CR/LF</i>. Si vosse\n"
"modem ni respond nén al tchinne init, sayîz des ôtès\n"
"tchûzes chal\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tchwezi por vos</b>: CR/LF"

#: general.cpp:306
msgid "Connection Speed:"
msgstr "Roedeu do Raloyaedje:"

#: general.cpp:349
msgid ""
"Specifies the speed your modem and the serial\n"
"port talk to each other. You should begin with\n"
"the default of 38400 bits/sec. If everything\n"
"works you can try to increase this value, but to\n"
"no more than 115200 bits/sec (unless you know\n"
"that your serial port supports higher speeds)."
msgstr ""
"Po dîre a kene roedeu vosse modem eyet li pôrt\n"
"sereye s' atauchèt. Po cmincî, sayîz avou çu k' est\n"
"tchwezi por vos (38400 bits/seg.). Si totafwait rote\n"
"comufåt, assayîz di monter cisse valixhance, mins nén\n"
"pus hôt ki 115200 bits/seg. (a pus ki vos savoz\n"
"ki vosse pôrt sereye divize bén a des pus hôtès roedeu)."

#: general.cpp:364
msgid "Use Lock File"
msgstr "Eployî on fitchî di seraedje"

#: general.cpp:375
msgid ""
"To prevent other programs from accessing the\n"
"modem while a connection is established, a\n"
"file can be created to indicate that the modem\n"
"is in use. On Linux an example file would be\n"
"<i>/var/lock/LCK..ttyS1</i>\n"
"Here you can select whether this locking will\n"
"be done.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: On"
msgstr ""
"Po-z espaitchî des ôtes programes di sayî d' eployî\n"
"li modem cwand c' est ki vos estoz raloyî, i fåt\n"
"fé on fitchî ki dit ki li modem est ddja\n"
"eployî. Dizo Linux, li fitchî dîreut par egzimpe:\n"
"<i>/var/lock/LCK..ttyS1</i>\n"
"C' est chal ki vos poloz decider si ci fitchî la doet\n"
"esse fwait.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tchwezi por vos</b>: Eclitchî"

#: general.cpp:386
msgid "Modem Timeout:"
msgstr "Ratinde li modem:"

#: general.cpp:405
msgid ""
"This specifies how long <i>kppp</i> waits for a\n"
"<i>CONNECT</i> response from your modem. The\n"
"recommended value is 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Po dîre cobén di tins ki <i>kppp</i> ratind après\n"
"ene response <i>CONNECT</i> di vosse modem. Nos vos\n"
"consians do prinde 30 segondes."

#: general.cpp:466 main.cpp:734
msgid "Modem"
msgstr "Modem"

#: general.cpp:477
msgid "Busy Wait:"
msgstr "Ratinde (Ocupé):"

#: general.cpp:495
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of seconds to wait before\n"
"redial if all dialed numbers are busy. This is\n"
"necessary because some modems get stuck if the\n"
"same number is busy too often.\n"
"\n"
"The default is 0 seconds, you should not change\n"
"this unless you need to."
msgstr ""
"Po dîre cobén di tins (segondes) k' i fåt ratinde\n"
"ene response divant do rfé li limerô si tos les limerôs sont-st\n"
"ocupés. Vos dvoz tchwezi ene sacwè ca sacwants modems toumèt an rak\n"
"si li minme limerô est trop sovint ocupé.\n"
"\n"
"Li tins tchwezi por vos est di 0 segondes. Ni candjîz nén\n"
"çouchal, såf si vos estoz oblidjî."

#: general.cpp:509
msgid "Modem volume"
msgstr "Son do modem"

#: general.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Most modems have a speaker which makes\n"
"a lot of noise when dialing. Here you can\n"
"either turn this completely off or select a\n"
"lower volume.\n"
"\n"
"If this does not work for your modem,\n"
"you must modify the modem volume command"
msgstr ""
"D' abôrd tos les modems polèt fé bråmint do traeyin\n"
"å moumint k' i vos raloyèt. C' est chal ki vos poloz côper\n"
"li son ou bén el fé aler\n"
"moens foirt.\n"
"\n"
"Si cisse tchûze voci ni va nén po vosse modem,\n"
"vos dvoz candjî li cmande ki maistreye li son do modem."

# xxx uh?
#: general.cpp:533
msgid "Modem Asserts CD Line."
msgstr "Li modem acertineye ene roye CD."

#: general.cpp:541
msgid ""
"This controls how <i>kppp</i> detects that the modem\n"
"is not responding. Unless you are having\n"
"problems with this, do not modify this setting.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default</b>: off"
msgstr ""
"Po dîre comint-ce ki <i>kppp</i> trove ki li modem\n"
"ni respond nén. A pus ki vos årîz des\n"
"rûjhes, ni candjîz nén cisse tchûzes chal.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tchwezi por vos</b>: disclitchî"

#: general.cpp:554
msgid "Modem Commands"
msgstr "Comandes do modem"

#: general.cpp:556
msgid ""
"Allows you to change the AT command for\n"
"your modem."
msgstr ""
"Por vos candjî les cmandes AT di\n"
"vosse modem."

#: general.cpp:559
msgid "Query Modem"
msgstr "Interodjî li modem"

#: general.cpp:561
msgid ""
"Most modems support the ATI command set to\n"
"find out vendor and revision of your modem.\n"
"\n"
"Press this button to query your modem for\n"
"this information.  It can be useful to help\n"
"you setup the modem"
msgstr ""
"D' abôrd tos les modems compurdèt les cmandes ATI, ki\n"
"siervèt a trover li vindeu et li modeye di vosse modem.\n"
"\n"
"Clitchîz droci po-z interodjî vosse modem et lî\n"
"dmander ces informåcions la. Ele polèt esse ahessåves po vos aidî\n"
"a apontyî vosse modem"

#: general.cpp:568
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminå"

#: general.cpp:570
msgid ""
"Opens the built-in terminal program. You\n"
"can use this if you want to play around\n"
"with your modem's AT command set"
msgstr ""
"Po drovi li dvintrin programe di terminå. Siervoz è vos\n"
"so vos voloz djower ene miete avou\n"
"les cmandes AT di vosse modem."

# xxx ???
#: general.cpp:634
msgid "Throughput graph"
msgstr "Grafike di l' ovraedje"

#: general.cpp:643
msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Coleur di drî"

#: general.cpp:650
msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Coleur do scrît"

#: general.cpp:657
msgid "Input bytes color"
msgstr "Coleur po les bytes aberwetés"

#: general.cpp:664
msgid "Output bytes color"
msgstr "Coleur po les bytes eberwetés"

#: main.cpp:118
msgid "Recent changes in kppp"
msgstr "Dierins candjmints di kppp"

#: main.cpp:131
msgid ""
"From version 1.4.8 on, kppp has a new feature\n"
"called \"Quickhelp\". It's similar to a tooltip,\n"
"but you can activate it whenever you want.\n"
"\n"
"To activate it, simply click on a control like\n"
"a button or a label with the right mouse button.\n"
"If the item supports Quickhelp, a popup menu\n"
"will appear leading to Quickhelp.\n"
"\n"
"To test it, right-click somewhere in this text."
msgstr ""
"A pårti del modeye 1.4.8, kppp a ene novele usteye\n"
"lomeye \"Côp di Spale al Vole\". Ele rishonne ås racsegnetes,\n"
"mins vos l' poloz enonder cwand vos voloz.\n"
"\n"
"Po l' enonder, vos n' avoz k' a clitchî so on\n"
"boton, ene etikete evnd. avou li droet boton.\n"
"Si li cayet ki vos avoz clitchî sait dner on Côp di Spale al Vole,\n"
"vos vieroz spiter on menu ki vos aidrè.\n"
"\n"
"Po sayî, clitchîz avou li droet boton ene sawice è ci texe ci."

#: main.cpp:143
msgid "Don't show this hint again"
msgstr "Ni pus mostrer cisse racsegne"

#: main.cpp:162
msgid ""
"This is an example for <b>QuickHelp</b>.\n"
"This window will stay open until you\n"
"click a mouse button or a hit a key.\n"
msgstr ""
"Çouci e-st èn egzimpe di <b>Côp di Spale al Vole</b>.\n"
"Li purnea dimorrè drovu djusk' a tant ki vos\n"
"clitchîxhe avou li soris ou ki vos tapexhe so ene tape.\n"

#: main.cpp:413
#, c-format
msgid ""
"kppp can't create or read from\n"
"%s."
msgstr ""
"kppp ni sait fé ou lere\n"
"%s."

#: main.cpp:444
#, c-format
msgid ""
"kppp has detected a %s file.\n"
"\n"
"Another instance of kppp seems to be running under\n"
"process-ID %d.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure that you are not running another kppp,\n"
"delete the pid file, and restart kppp."
msgstr ""
"kppp a trové on fitchî %s.\n"
"\n"
"Ça vout dîre ki kppp toûne dedja avou li\n"
"limerô di processus %d.\n"
"\n"
"Si vos estoz sheur ki kppp ni toûne nén co,\n"
"disfacez li fitchî pid et 's renondez kppp."

#: main.cpp:450
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Moussî foû"

#: main.cpp:513
msgid "Connect to: "
msgstr "Si raloyî a: "

#: main.cpp:525
msgid "Login ID:"
msgstr "No po moussî dvins:"

#: main.cpp:538
msgid ""
"Type in the username that you got from your\n"
"ISP. This is especially important for PAP\n"
"and CHAP. You may omit this when you use\n"
"terminal-based or script-based authentication.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: case is important here:\n"
"<i>myusername</i> is not the same as <i>MyUserName</i>!"
msgstr ""
"Tapez li no d' ûzeu ki vos avoz rçût di voste ahesseu\n"
"Eternet. C' est pår consecant po PAP eyet\n"
"CHAP. Vos poloz leyî çouci vûde vos vos fjhoz rconoxhe\n"
"a pårti d' on terminå ou d' on scrip.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Asteme</b>: ni vos brouyîz nén dins les ptites et les grandès letes:\n"
"<i>mino</i>, ci n' est nén li minme ki <i>MiNo</i>!"

#: main.cpp:547
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Secret:"

#: main.cpp:561
msgid ""
"Type in the password that you got from your\n"
"ISP. This is especially important for PAP\n"
"and CHAP. You may omit this when you use\n"
"terminal-based or script-based authentication.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: case is important here:\n"
"<i>mypassword</i> is not the same as <i>MyPassword</i>!"
msgstr ""
"Tapez droci li scret (mot di passe) ki voste ahesseu Eternet\n"
"vos a dné. C' est pår consecant po PAP eyet\n"
"CHAP. Vos poloz leyî çouci vûde vos vos fjhoz rconoxhe\n"
"a pårti d' on terminå ou d' on scrip.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Asteme</b>: ni vos brouyîz nén dins les ptites et les grandès letes:\n"
"<i>miscret</i>, ci n' est nén li minme ki <i>MiScret</i>!"

#: main.cpp:575
msgid "Show Log Window"
msgstr "Mostrer li purnea avou l' istwere"

#: main.cpp:582
msgid ""
"This controls whether a log window is shown.\n"
"A log window shows the communication between\n"
"<i>kppp</i> and your modem. This will help you\n"
"in tracking down problems.\n"
"\n"
"Turn it off if <i>kppp</i> routinely connects without\n"
"problems"
msgstr ""
"Po dîre s' i fåt mostrer on purnea avou l' istwere\n"
"di l' atauchaedje inte\n"
"<i>kppp</i> eyet vosse modem. Çoula vos pout aidî\n"
"a vey wice k' i gn a yåk ki n' va nén.\n"
"\n"
"Disclitchîz çouchal si <i>kppp</i> si raloye sins aroke\n"
"d' acostumance"

#: main.cpp:605
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Apontyî"

#: main.cpp:621
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Si raloyî"

#: main.cpp:701
#, c-format
msgid ""
"No such Account:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Ci conte ci n' egzisteye nén:\n"
"%s"

#: main.cpp:716
msgid "kppp Configuration"
msgstr "Apontiaedje di kppp"

#: main.cpp:732
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Contes"

#: main.cpp:733
msgid "Device"
msgstr "Indjin"

#: main.cpp:735
msgid "PPP"
msgstr "PPP"

#: main.cpp:736
msgid "Graph"
msgstr "Grafike"

#: main.cpp:880
msgid "Timeout expired while waiting for the PPP interface to come up!"
msgstr "Li tins ki dji dveu ratinde PPP est hute!"

#: main.cpp:885
msgid "The pppd daemon died unexpectedly!"
msgstr "Li demon pppd a moru tot d' on côp!"

#: main.cpp:893
msgid "Details..."
msgstr "Savu did pus..."

# xxx what's a helper process?
#: main.cpp:925
msgid ""
"Sorry. kppp's helper process just died.\n"
"\n"
"Since a further execution would be pointless, kppp will shut down right now."
msgstr ""
"Dji rgrete. L' aidant processus di kppp vént do mori.\n"
"\n"
"Come i gn åreut pont d' avance di s' renonder, kppp si va cloyu sol côp."

#: main.cpp:959
#, c-format
msgid ""
"kppp can not find:\n"
