#: runtests.cpp:386
msgid ""
"You´re not allowed to dial out with kppp.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"Vos n' avoz nén li permission di vos raloyî på telefone avou kppp.\n"
"Alez vey li manaedjeu do sistinme."

#: runtests.cpp:403
msgid ""
"This kernel has no PPP support, neither\n"
"compiled in nor via the kernel module\n"
"loader.\n"
"\n"
"To solve this problem:\n"
"  * contact your system adminstrator\n"
"or\n"
"  * install a kernel with PPP support\n"
msgstr ""
"Li navea di vosse maisse programe n' a nén PPP, ni\n"
"copilé dîrek divins li navea, ni come difoûtrin\n"
"module.\n"
"\n"
"Po passer hute di l' aroke:\n"
"  * alez vey li manaedjeu do sistinme\n"
"eyet\n"
"  * astalez on navea avou PPP\n"

#: runtests.cpp:425
msgid ""
"Cannot find the pppd-daemon!\n"
"\n"
"Make sure that pppd is installed and\n"
"you have entered the correct path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dji n' trove nén li demon pppd!\n"
"\n"
"Estoz-ve sheure ki pppd e-st astalé\n"
"et ki vos avoz dné li bon tchmin?\n"

#: runtests.cpp:438
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission\n"
"to start pppd!\n"
"\n"
"Contact your system administrator\n"
"and ask to get access to pppd."
msgstr ""
"Vos n' avoz nén li permission\n"
"d' enonder pppd!\n"
"\n"
"Alez vey li manaedjeu do sistinme\n"
"et lî dmander po savu eployî pppd."

#: runtests.cpp:449 runtests.cpp:463
msgid ""
"pppd is not properly installed!\n"
"\n"
"The pppd binary must be installed\n"
"with the SUID bit set. Contact your\n"
"system administrator."
msgstr ""
"pppd n' est nén astalé comufåt!\n"
"\n"
"Li programe pppd doet esse astalé\n"
"avou li bit SUID metu. Alez vey li\n"
"manaedjeu do sistinme."

#: runtests.cpp:497
msgid ""
"kppp has detected a 'lock' option in /etc/ppp/options.\n"
"\n"
"This option has to be removed since kppp takes care of device locking "
"itself.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"Li fitchî /etc/ppp/options a ene roye avou 'lock'.\n"
"\n"
"Cisse tchûze la doet esse waesteye ca c' est kppp ki s' ocuper di serer"
"l' indjin al clé.\n"
"Alez vey li manaedjeu do sistinme."

#: runtests.cpp:521
msgid ""
"is missing!\n"
"\n"
"Ask your system administrator to create\n"
"a non-empty file that has appropriate\n"
"read and write permissions."
msgstr ""
"n' est nén la!\n"
"\n"
"Dimandez å manaedjeu do sistinme do fé\n"
"on fitchî nén vûde avou les permissions (lere\n"
"eyet scrîre) ki convnèt."

