#: ppplog.cpp:136
msgid ""
"You have launched pppd before the remote server was ready to establish a PPP "
"connection.\n"
"Please use the terminal-based login to verify"
msgstr ""
"Vos avoz enondé pppd divant ki li serveu å lon seye presse a fé on"
"raloyaedje PPP.\n"
"Moussî dvins avou li terminå po vey cwè."

# xxx what's a peer system, the one you're connected to?
#: ppplog.cpp:141
msgid "You haven't started the PPP software on the peer system."
msgstr "Vos n' avoz nén enondé li programe PPP do sistinme acoplé"

#: ppplog.cpp:144
msgid "Check that you supplied the correct username and password!"
msgstr "Waitîz si vos avoz dné li bon no d' ûzeu eyet li bon scret!"

#: ppplog.cpp:147
msgid ""
"You shouldn't pass 'lock' as an argument to pppd. Check /etc/ppp/options and "
"~/.ppprc"
msgstr ""
"Vos n' duvrîz nén bouter 'lock' come årgumint po pppd. Loukîz dins /etc/ppp/options eyet"
"~/.ppprc"

#: ppplog.cpp:151
msgid ""
"The remote system does not seem to answer to\n"
"configuration request! Contact your provider!"
msgstr ""
"Dj' a l' ideye ki li sistinme å lon ni respond nén a vosse\n"
"dimande! Atauchîz voste ahesseu!"

#: ppplog.cpp:155
msgid ""
"You have passed an invalid option to pppd. See `man pppd' for a complete "
"list of valid arguments."
msgstr ""
"Yene di vos tchûzes po pppd est mwaijhe. Waitîz è manuel (`man pppd') po vey"
"ene djîveye di tos les årgumints ki convnèt."

#: ppplog.cpp:170
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notice that the remote system has sent the following message:\n"
"\"%s\"\n"
"This may give you a hint why the the connection has failed."
msgstr ""
"Li sistinme å lon a avoyî ci messaedje ci:\n"
"\"%s\"\n"
"Ça pôreut volu dîre ki li raloyaedje ni s' a nén fwait."

#: ppplog.cpp:189
msgid "Sorry. Can't help you here."
msgstr "Dji rgrete, la, dji n' vos såreu aidî."

#: ppplog.cpp:206
msgid ""
"KPPP could not prepare a PPP log. It´s very likely\n"
"that pppd was started without the \"debug\" option.\n"
"\n"
"Without this option it´s difficult to find out PPP\n"
"problems, so you should turn on the debug option.\n"
"\n"
"Shall I turn it on now?"
msgstr ""
"KPPP n' a nén parvinu a-z aprester ene istwere di PPP. C' est dandjureu\n"
"pace ki pppd s' a enondé sins li tchûze \"debug\".\n"
"\n"
"Sins cisse tchûze la, c' est målåjhey di discovri les arokes\n"
"dins PPP. C' est ça ki vos duvrîz mete li tchûze 'debug'.\n"
"\n"
"Voloz-ve ki djel mete por vos tot d' shûte?"

#: ppplog.cpp:217
msgid ""
"The \"debug\" option has been added. You\n"
"should now try to reconnect. If that fails\n"
"again, you will get a PPP log that may help\n"
"you to track down the connection problem."
msgstr ""
"Dj' a radjouté li tchûze \"debug\". Asteure,\n"
"vos duvrîz rsayî di v' raloyî. Si vos fjhoz co on côp\n"
"berwete, vos åroz ene istwere di PPP ki vos pôrè mutwè\n"
"aidî a vey çu ki n' va nén."

#: ppplog.cpp:232
msgid "PPP log"
msgstr "Istwere di PPP"

